To display LACP information for a port-channel, use the show lacp port-channel Privileged EXEC mode command. `SG550X#show lacp port-channel[
port_channel_number
]` The command below is the command we used to display LACP information for a port-channel. `SG550X#show lacp port-channel 1` The MAC address has been blurred out in the picture below.

(Optional) To
end the current configuration session and return to the Privileged EXEC mode,
use the end command. `RADIUS(config-radius-server-group)#end`
